# What a Docker build of this repository must not copy in. The decision service
# image (planes/execution/Dockerfile) copies the repository and runs `npm ci`
# inside the image, so anything installed or built on the host is noise at best
# and a different platform's native binaries at worst.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/storybook-static
**/build
.git
engines/kotlin/.gradle
docs/demo
docs/evaluation
